(body.model || 'workbuddy-web-search', search, query));\n        } catch (e) {\n          if (e?.code === 'RATE_LIMIT_ABORTED' || e?.code === 'WEB_SEARCH_ABORTED' || ac.signal.aborted) return;\n          const rateLimited = e?.code === 'RATE_LIMITED' || e?.code === 'WEB_SEARCH_RATE_LIMITED';\n          const status = rateLimited ? 429 : (Number(e?.status) || (e?.code === 'WEB_SEARCH_TIMEOUT' ? 504 : 502));\n          recordRequest({\n            model: 'web-search', kind: 'search', stream: false, ms: Date.now() - startedAt,\n            ok: false, status, code: e?.code || null, error: e?.message || String(e),\n          });\n          log('web_search (anthropic) failed', status, e?.code || '', shortError(e?.message || e, 200));\n          const retryAfter = rateLimited\n            ? Math.max(1, Math.ceil((e?.retryAfterMs || 1000) / 1000))\n            : (status === 429 ? Math.max(1, Math.ceil((e?.retryAfterMs || 5000) / 1000)) : 0);\n          return json(res, status, {\n            type: 'error',\n            error: {\n              type: rateLimited ? 'rate_limit_error' : 'api_error',\n              message: `workbuddy-bridge: ${shortError(e?.message || e, 300)}`,\n              ...(e?.code ? { code: e.code } : {}),\n            },\n          }, retryAfter ? { 'Retry-After': String(retryAfter) } : {});\n        }\n      }\n\n      // Anthropic 的 `stream` 缺省是 false（与 OpenAI 相反）\n      const wantStream = body.stream === true;\n      /*\n       * 非字符串 model（数组 / 数字 / 对象）直接 400 —— 与 OpenAI 路径一致。\n       * 原先 `typeof body.model === 'string' ? ... : ''` 会把它当成\"没给\"，\n       * 静默使用默认模型：用户传错了参数，却在跑另一个模型。native search 分支\n       * 在更上面（它不走模型），所以放在这里不会影响那条路径。\n       */\n      if (body.model !== undefined && body.model !== null && typeof body.model !== 'string') {\n        const message = 'workbuddy-bridge: model must be a string';\n        recordRequest({ model: '', stream: wantStream, ms: 0, ok: false, status: 400, code: null, error: message });\n        return json(res, 400, { type: 'error', error: { type: 'invalid_request_error', message } });\n      }\n      /*\n       * 模型名解析（与 Responses 共用 `resolveRequestedModel`）：剥后缀 → 目录精确命中\n       * → 客户端别名 → 未知 id 明确报错。**不再静默换成别的模型**（issue #18）。\n       */\n      /*\n       * 模型 id 会进出站的 `X-Model-ID` 头：**长度**与**字符集**先校验\n       * （与 `/v1/chat/completions` 同一套护栏）—— 否则超长或带非可见 ASCII 的 id\n       * 会让 Node 的 http.request 直接抛异常，客户端只会收到 500。\n       */\n      const requestedName = typeof body.model === 'string' ? body.model : '';\n      if (requestedName.length > MAX_MODEL_ID_LEN) {\n        const message = `workbuddy-bridge: model id too long (${requestedName.length} chars, max ${MAX_MODEL_ID_LEN})`;\n        const trimmed = shortError(requestedName, MAX_MODEL_ID_LEN);\n        log('rejected oversized model id (anthropic)', trimmed);\n        recordRequest({\n          model: trimmed, stream: wantStream, ms: 0, ok: false, status: 400, code: null, error: message,\n        });\n        return json(res, 400, { type: 'error', error: { type: 'invalid_request_error', message } });\n      }\n      if (requestedName && !HEADER_SAFE_RE.test(requestedName)) {\n        const message = 'workbuddy-bridge: model id contains characters that are not allowed in a header';\n        const trimmed = shortError(requestedName, MAX_MODEL_ID_LEN);\n        log('rejected unsafe model id (anthropic)', trimmed);\n        recordRequest({\n          model: trimmed, stream: wantStream, ms: 0, ok: false, status: 400, code: null, error: message,\n        });\n        return json(res, 400, { type: 'error', error: { type: 'invalid_request_error', message } });\n      }\n      const model = resolveAnthropicModel(body.model);\n      const messages = anthropicToOpenAIMessages(body);\n      const tools = anthropicToolsToOpenAIMessages(body.tools);\n      const toolChoice = anthropicToolChoiceToOpenAI(body.tool_choice);\n\n      const oai = { model, messages, stream: true, stream_options: { include_usage: true } };\n      if (tools